{"content_hash": "d315de0add58a662", "version_id": 333, "article_id": 34, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Author Correction: Histone Readers MLLT1 and MLLT3 Study Gets Name Fix", "title_zh": "作者更正：组蛋白阅读器 MLLT1 和 MLLT3 研究更正了作者姓名", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11266-0", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1710447503692-8364152e431c?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8YXV0aG9yJTIwY29ycmVjdGlvbnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkxNTUwMzAwfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Benja Godin on Unsplash", "author": "Benja Godin", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@benja_godin?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-person-writing-on-a-piece-of-paper-with-a-pen-SgZ6nWHi8FY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(212, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(250, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SCIENCE", "seed": "14846e897d91"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 240, "reading_minutes": 1.2, "lead": "A scientific paper about how certain proteins help the immune system has been corrected. The correction fixes a spelling mistake in one author's name.", "lead_zh": "一篇关于某些蛋白质如何帮助免疫系统的科学论文发布了更正。这次更正修正了一位作者姓名的拼写错误。", "preview": "On 8 October 2026, the journal Nature published an author correction for a study that came out on 30 September 2026. The study is called \"Hi", "preview_zh": "2026年10月8日，学术期刊《自然》发布了一篇论文的作者更正。这篇论文于2026年9月30日发表，标题是《组蛋白阅读器 MLLT1 和 MLLT3 将 AID 集中以赋予位点特异性》。更正很短，因为只修正了作者名单中的一个小错误。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 330, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/34/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 100.475, "size_bytes": 606528, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 279, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@e8acbf2/content/data/versions/333.json", "paragraphs": ["On 8 October 2026, the journal Nature published an author correction for a study that came out on 30 September 2026. The study is called \"Histone readers MLLT1 and MLLT3 concentrate AID to confer locus specificity.\" The correction is short, because it only fixes one small mistake in the author list.", "In the first version, the surname of author Marcelo A. Navarrete was spelled incorrectly as \"Navarrette.\" The journal has now corrected this in both the online HTML version and the PDF version. Although the mistake was small, correct names are important for researchers, because they help people find and cite the right work.", "The original study looked at proteins called MLLT1 and MLLT3, which are histone readers. These proteins help direct a molecule called AID to specific places in DNA. This process matters for class switch recombination and somatic hypermutation, which are key steps in how immune cells make different types of antibodies.", "The research involved many scientists from institutions in Canada and Chile. Some of them work at the Institut de Recherches Cliniques de Montréal (IRCM) and at McGill University. The corresponding author is Javier M. Di Noia, who can be contacted for more information about the study.", "Although this correction only changes a name, it shows that science checks its records carefully. If a reader wants to learn more, they can find the original article and the correction online, using the DOI numbers provided by the journal."], "paragraphs_zh": ["2026年10月8日，学术期刊《自然》发布了一篇论文的作者更正。这篇论文于2026年9月30日发表，标题是《组蛋白阅读器 MLLT1 和 MLLT3 将 AID 集中以赋予位点特异性》。更正很短，因为只修正了作者名单中的一个小错误。", "在第一版中，作者 Marcelo A. Navarrete 的姓氏被错误地拼写成了“Navarrette”。期刊现在已经在在线 HTML 版和 PDF 版中更正了这一点。虽然这个错误很小，但正确的姓名对研究人员来说很重要，因为这样人们才能找到并引用正确的成果。", "原研究关注的是名为 MLLT1 和 MLLT3 的蛋白质，它们属于组蛋白阅读器。这些蛋白质帮助把一种叫 AID 的分子引导到 DNA 的特定位置。这个过程对类别转换重组和体细胞超突变很重要，而这两步是免疫细胞制造不同类型抗体的关键。", "这项研究涉及许多来自加拿大和智利机构的科学家。其中一些人在蒙特利尔临床研究所（IRCM）和麦吉尔大学工作。通讯作者是 Javier M. Di Noia，如需更多信息可以联系他。", "虽然这次更正只改了一个名字，但它表明科学会认真检查自己的记录。如果读者想了解更多，可以通过期刊提供的 DOI 编号在网上找到原论文和更正。"], "body": "On 8 October 2026, the journal Nature published an author correction for a study that came out on 30 September 2026. The study is called \"Histone readers MLLT1 and MLLT3 concentrate AID to confer locus specificity.\" The correction is short, because it only fixes one small mistake in the author list.\n\nIn the first version, the surname of author Marcelo A. Navarrete was spelled incorrectly as \"Navarrette.\" The journal has now corrected this in both the online HTML version and the PDF version. Although the mistake was small, correct names are important for researchers, because they help people find and cite the right work.\n\nThe original study looked at proteins called MLLT1 and MLLT3, which are histone readers. These proteins help direct a molecule called AID to specific places in DNA. This process matters for class switch recombination and somatic hypermutation, which are key steps in how immune cells make different types of antibodies.\n\nThe research involved many scientists from institutions in Canada and Chile. Some of them work at the Institut de Recherches Cliniques de Montréal (IRCM) and at McGill University. The corresponding author is Javier M. Di Noia, who can be contacted for more information about the study.\n\nAlthough this correction only changes a name, it shows that science checks its records carefully. If a reader wants to learn more, they can find the original article and the correction online, using the DOI numbers provided by the journal.", "body_zh": "2026年10月8日，学术期刊《自然》发布了一篇论文的作者更正。这篇论文于2026年9月30日发表，标题是《组蛋白阅读器 MLLT1 和 MLLT3 将 AID 集中以赋予位点特异性》。更正很短，因为只修正了作者名单中的一个小错误。\n\n在第一版中，作者 Marcelo A. Navarrete 的姓氏被错误地拼写成了“Navarrette”。期刊现在已经在在线 HTML 版和 PDF 版中更正了这一点。虽然这个错误很小，但正确的姓名对研究人员来说很重要，因为这样人们才能找到并引用正确的成果。\n\n原研究关注的是名为 MLLT1 和 MLLT3 的蛋白质，它们属于组蛋白阅读器。这些蛋白质帮助把一种叫 AID 的分子引导到 DNA 的特定位置。这个过程对类别转换重组和体细胞超突变很重要，而这两步是免疫细胞制造不同类型抗体的关键。\n\n这项研究涉及许多来自加拿大和智利机构的科学家。其中一些人在蒙特利尔临床研究所（IRCM）和麦吉尔大学工作。通讯作者是 Javier M. Di Noia，如需更多信息可以联系他。\n\n虽然这次更正只改了一个名字，但它表明科学会认真检查自己的记录。如果读者想了解更多，可以通过期刊提供的 DOI 编号在网上找到原论文和更正。", "text": "On 8 October 2026, the journal Nature published an author correction for a study that came out on 30 September 2026. The study is called \"Histone readers MLLT1 and MLLT3 concentrate AID to confer locus specificity.\" The correction is short, because it only fixes one small mistake in the author list. In the first version, the surname of author Marcelo A. Navarrete was spelled incorrectly as \"Navarrette.\" The journal has now corrected this in both the online HTML version and the PDF version. Although the mistake was small, correct names are important for researchers, because they help people find and cite the right work. The original study looked at proteins called MLLT1 and MLLT3, which are histone readers. These proteins help direct a molecule called AID to specific places in DNA. This process matters for class switch recombination and somatic hypermutation, which are key steps in how immune cells make different types of antibodies. The research involved many scientists from institutions in Canada and Chile. Some of them work at the Institut de Recherches Cliniques de Montréal (IRCM) and at McGill University. The corresponding author is Javier M. Di Noia, who can be contacted for more information about the study. Although this correction only changes a name, it shows that science checks its records carefully. If a reader wants to learn more, they can find the original article and the correction online, using the DOI numbers provided by the journal.", "vocab": [{"word": "correction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "更正", "note": "常指对已发表内容的修正"}, {"word": "surname", "pos": "noun", "zh": "姓氏", "note": "也可说 last name"}, {"word": "journal", "pos": "noun", "zh": "学术期刊", "note": "如 Nature、Science 等"}, {"word": "author", "pos": "noun", "zh": "作者", "note": "论文或书籍的写作者"}, {"word": "publish", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发表", "note": "常用被动语态 be published"}, {"word": "protein", "pos": "noun", "zh": "蛋白质", "note": "生物体中的重要大分子"}, {"word": "immune", "pos": "adj", "zh": "免疫的", "note": "immune system 免疫系统"}, {"word": "antibody", "pos": "noun", "zh": "抗体", "note": "免疫细胞产生的蛋白质"}, {"word": "institution", "pos": "noun", "zh": "机构", "note": "如大学、研究所"}, {"word": "DOI", "pos": "noun", "zh": "数字对象标识符", "note": "论文的唯一编号"}], "title_original": "Author Correction: Histone readers MLLT1 and MLLT3 concentrate AID to confer locus specificity", "summary_original": "Nature, Published online: 08 October 2026;\ndoi:10.1038/s41586-026-11266-0\nAuthor Correction: Histone readers MLLT1 and MLLT3 concentrate AID to confer locus specificity", "body_original": "Download PDF\nAuthor Correction\nPublished:\n08 October 2026\nAuthor Correction: Histone readers MLLT1 and MLLT3 concentrate AID to confer locus specificity\nNoé Seija\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0003-2223-1291\n1\n,\n2\n,\nSophia Gannon\n1\n,\n3\nna1\n,\nKíra A. Häfner\nORCID:\norcid.org/0009-0008-1069-4647\n1\n,\n2\nna1\n,\nTim M. Gemeinhardt\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0003-0241-1009\n1\n,\n4\nna1\n,\nJana Ridani\n1\n,\n4\n,\nDiego Alvarez\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0003-0753-274X\n5\n,\nMélanie Provencher\n1\n,\n6\n,\nPoorani Ganesh Subramani\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0002-7318-6577\n1\n,\nChristian Poitras\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0001-6444-7600\n1\n,\nEva-Maria Piskor\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0003-2109-4627\n1\n,\n4\n,\nTarik Möröy\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0003-4284-9849\n1\n,\n4\n,\n7\n,\nNicholas Vonniessen\n4\n,\n8\n,\nBruce Mazer\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0003-4018-1419\n4\n,\n8\n,\n9\n,\nMarcelo A. Navarrete\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0002-2044-9548\n5\n,\nNicole J. Francis\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0002-1810-2959\n1\n,\n4\n,\n5\n,\nFrançois Robert\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0003-1054-5920\n1\n,\n2\n,\n4\n&\n…\nJavier M. Di Noia\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0003-2896-0321\n1\n,\n2\n,\n3\n,\n4\n,\n6\n,\n10\nShow a